   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general business law, in relation to regulating the sale\nof kratom products",
    "basePrintNo": "S8780",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8780-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §398-g, Gen Bus L (as proposed in S.8285 & A.5852-A)",
    "lawSection": "General Business Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8780\n\nSPONSOR: SKOUFIS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the general business law, in relation to regulating the\nsale of kratom products\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis is a chapter amendment to L.2025, c.655, to amend the definition of\nKratom, and amend the requirements of the warning label.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis legislation amends the underlying chapter amendment by amending the\ndefinition of Kratom to be more precise, to amend the warning label to\nhave more specific disclosures, and to expand the scope of liability\nbeyond manufacturers to any person.\n\n \nEXISTING LAW:\n\nNone.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation is a negotiated change to the underlying chapter.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nChapter amendment to Chapter 655 of the Laws of 2025. S.8285 and\nA.5852-A, both passed the Senate and Assembly, respectfully, in June\n2025.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the same date and in the same manner as a\nchapter of the laws of 2025 amending the general business law, in\nrelation to regulating the sale of kratom products, as proposed in\nlegislative bills numbers S.8285 and A.5852-A, takes effect.\n",
